{"seq":2,"slug":"cash-flow-forecast-visibility","title":"跨主体现金流预测与可视性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/position-netting-liquidity/cash-flow-forecast-visibility","wordCount":2024,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨主体现金流预测与可视性\">跨主体现金流预测与可视性</h1><p>头寸回答&quot;此刻有多少钱&quot;，预测回答&quot;未来某时刻有多少钱&quot;。前者是读取，后者是推断——而推断总是错的，问题只在于错多少、错在哪一类。资金池的价值上限往往不由归集技术决定，而由<strong>预测的准确度</strong>决定：预测准，池子里的钱就能少留冗余、多去投资；预测偏，池子就必须留一大笔缓冲，缓冲的成本直接吃掉全部收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>现金流预测的输入有三类：<strong>确定的</strong>（已签合同的应收应付、已排定的工资与税费）、<strong>统计的</strong>（基于历史分布推断的收付）和<strong>推断的</strong>（从业务驱动因子推演，如销量 × 单价 × 账期）。三类输入的可靠性依次下降，预测方法因此也不同。</p>\n<p>可视性（visibility）是预测的前提，指集团对成员资金状况的可见程度。这不仅是技术问题，更是治理问题：成员是否愿意把账户余额实时暴露给集团、是否授权集团直接扣划、数据以什么频率上报。可见性不足时，预测就退化成&quot;根据上期数据外推&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[预测输入] --&gt; B[确定项 合同与排程]&#10;    A --&gt; C[统计项 历史分布]&#10;    A --&gt; D[推断项 业务驱动]&#10;    B --&gt; E[直接计入]&#10;    C --&gt; F[按分布抽样或期望值]&#10;    D --&gt; G[驱动因子模型]&#10;    E --&gt; H[现金头寸预测曲线]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[滚动修正 实际 vs 预测]&#10;    I --&gt; J[偏差归因]&#10;    J --&gt; K[回写参数与权重]&#10;    K --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[预测输入] --&gt; B[确定项 合同与排程]\n    A --&gt; C[统计项 历史分布]\n    A --&gt; D[推断项 业务驱动]\n    B --&gt; E[直接计入]\n    C --&gt; F[按分布抽样或期望值]\n    D --&gt; G[驱动因子模型]\n    E --&gt; H[现金头寸预测曲线]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[滚动修正 实际 vs 预测]\n    I --&gt; J[偏差归因]\n    J --&gt; K[回写参数与权重]\n    K --&gt; H</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入类型</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n<th>预测方法</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>已签合同应收</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>直接计入，按账期排程</td>\n<td>事件驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已排税务/工资</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>直接计入，日期固定</td>\n<td>日历驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史平均收付</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>分布拟合，期望 + 分位</td>\n<td>每日滚动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>销量驱动收入</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>驱动因子模型</td>\n<td>每日/每周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>突发大额</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>场景与例外清单</td>\n<td>事件驱动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"预测的粒度与时间桶\">预测的粒度与时间桶</h2><h3 id=\"三个时间尺度\">三个时间尺度</h3><p>资金预测按用途分三个尺度，各自精度与用途不同：</p>\n<p>**短期（0–13 周）**是滚动现金预测的主体，用于隔夜资金安排、短期投资与透支额度管理。这一尺度要求逐日、逐币种、逐主体的粒度，因为它要驱动真实交易。</p>\n<p>**中期（3–12 月）**用于融资规划与额度申请，粒度可以退化到周或月，重点是捕捉趋势与结构性缺口。</p>\n<p>**长期（1–3 年）**用于资本结构与战略融资，通常不追求精度，追求方向与情景覆盖。</p>\n<p>工程上最常见的错误是用一个模型覆盖三个尺度。短期预测的核心是<strong>减少方差</strong>（把已知项与未知项分开），长期预测的核心是<strong>覆盖情景</strong>（把不同经营假设下的资金需求都算出来）。两者的建模逻辑几乎相反。</p>\n<p>这一分层不是集团财务的独创，它来自银行流动性风险管理的成熟做法：巴塞尔委员会把流动性定义为&quot;银行能够为资产增长提供资金并在债务到期时履约的能力&quot;，并指出这些义务具有不确定性——&quot;受外部事件与其他主体行为的影响&quot;；其稳健框架要求&quot;识别并计量全部流动性风险，包括或有流动性风险&quot;、设计并使用&quot;严重压力测试情景&quot;、以及保持&quot;稳健且可操作的应急资金计划&quot;，并把&quot;日内流动性风险与抵押品的管理&quot;列为需要更细致处理的部分（见 <a href=\"https://www.bis.org/publ/bcbs144.pdf\">Basel Committee, Principles for Sound Liquidity Risk Management and Supervision</a>）。集团司库把同一套逻辑迁移到自有资金上：先按期限分层识别义务，再按情景量化缺口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时间桶的选择\">时间桶的选择</h3><p>时间桶的宽度决定预测的可执行性。桶太宽（比如按周），无法支持每日资金调度；桶太窄（比如按小时），统计项没有足够样本，只能退化成确定性预测。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;forecastId&quot;: &quot;GRP-2026W40&quot;,&#10;  &quot;baseCurrency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot;,&#10;  &quot;buckets&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;date&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28&quot;, &quot;resolution&quot;: &quot;daily&quot;, &quot;confirmed&quot;: true },&#10;    { &quot;date&quot;: &quot;2026-09-29&quot;, &quot;resolution&quot;: &quot;daily&quot;, &quot;confirmed&quot;: false },&#10;    { &quot;week&quot;: &quot;2026-W41&quot;, &quot;resolution&quot;: &quot;weekly&quot;, &quot;confidence&quot;: 0.82 },&#10;    { &quot;month&quot;: &quot;2026-11&quot;, &quot;resolution&quot;: &quot;monthly&quot;, &quot;confidence&quot;: 0.61 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;sources&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;contracted&quot;: 8200000,&#10;    &quot;statistical&quot;: 1450000,&#10;    &quot;inferred&quot;: 640000&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;method&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;statisticalModel&quot;: &quot;empirical_quantile&quot;,&#10;    &quot;quantiles&quot;: [0.1, 0.5, 0.9],&#10;    &quot;reconciliation&quot;: &quot;actual_vs_forecast_daily&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"forecastId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GRP-2026W40\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"baseCurrency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"buckets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resolution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"daily\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"confirmed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-29\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resolution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"daily\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"confirmed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"week\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-W41\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resolution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"weekly\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"confidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.82</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"month\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-11\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resolution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"monthly\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"confidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.61</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sources\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"contracted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8200000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"statistical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1450000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"inferred\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">640000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"statisticalModel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"empirical_quantile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"quantiles\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reconciliation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"actual_vs_forecast_daily\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分位数而非点估计\">分位数而非点估计</h3><p>预测应以分位数形式给出，而不是单一数字。资金管理的用法天然是不对称的：预测偏低会导致临时高成本融资，预测偏高会导致闲置资金浪费。设净现金流的 10% / 50% / 90% 分位分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0.1</mn></msub><mtext>、</mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0.5</mn></msub><mtext>、</mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0.9</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{0.1}、q_{0.5}、q_{0.9}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>流动性缓冲</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>∗</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>可投资资金</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>∗</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{流动性缓冲} = -q*{0.1}, \\qquad \\text{可投资资金} = q*{0.1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">流动性缓冲</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可投资资金</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6597em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也即：按悲观分位保留缓冲，按乐观分位之外的确定性部分安排投资。这一规则把预测的不确定性直接转译成了资金安排，且不依赖对分布的参数化假设——经验分位数即可实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"偏差归因与预测修正\">偏差归因与预测修正</h2><h3 id=\"偏差的三个来源\">偏差的三个来源</h3><p>预测偏差不是随机噪声，它有结构。把偏差拆成三类，才能针对性修正：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏差来源</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>修正方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时序偏差</td>\n<td>系统性早收/晚付</td>\n<td>调整账期参数（收款账期、付款账期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幅值偏差</td>\n<td>金额系统性高估/低估</td>\n<td>调整规模系数或驱动因子弹性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>例外事件</td>\n<td>偶发大额偏离</td>\n<td>例外清单，不污染基础模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把例外事件也塞进模型训练，会让模型为了拟合偶发大额而牺牲日常精度——这是资金预测模型最常见的退化路径。正确做法是维护一个例外清单，模型只学常态，例外单独跟踪。</p>\n<h3 id=\"滚动修正的实现\">滚动修正的实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH fc AS (&#10;  SELECT forecast_date, currency, bucket_date, p50 AS forecast_amount&#10;  FROM cash_forecast&#10;  WHERE forecast_date = DATE &#39;2026-09-28&#39;&#10;),&#10;act AS (&#10;  SELECT bucket_date, currency, SUM(amount) AS actual_amount&#10;  FROM cash_actual&#10;  WHERE bucket_date BETWEEN DATE &#39;2026-09-01&#39; AND DATE &#39;2026-09-27&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY bucket_date, currency&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  fc.currency,&#10;  DATE_TRUNC(&#39;week&#39;, fc.bucket_date) AS week,&#10;  SUM(fc.forecast_amount)                                  AS forecast,&#10;  COALESCE(SUM(act.actual_amount), 0)                      AS actual,&#10;  SUM(fc.forecast_amount) - COALESCE(SUM(act.actual_amount), 0) AS gap,&#10;  ROUND((SUM(fc.forecast_amount) - COALESCE(SUM(act.actual_amount), 0))&#10;        / NULLIF(SUM(fc.forecast_amount), 0), 4)           AS gap_ratio&#10;FROM fc&#10;LEFT JOIN act ON act.bucket_date = fc.bucket_date AND act.currency = fc.currency&#10;GROUP BY fc.currency, DATE_TRUNC(&#39;week&#39;, fc.bucket_date)&#10;ORDER BY week, fc.currency;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> forecast_date, currency, bucket_date, p50 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> forecast_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cash_forecast</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> forecast_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-28'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">act </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket_date, currency, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cash_actual</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-01'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-27'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket_date, currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  fc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  DATE_TRUNC(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'week'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bucket_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> week</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">forecast_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> forecast,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">act</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">actual_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">forecast_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">act</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">actual_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gap,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">forecast_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">act</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">actual_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">forecast_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gap_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> act </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> act</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bucket_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bucket_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> act</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, DATE_TRUNC(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'week'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bucket_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> week</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>gap_ratio</code> 按币种与周聚合后呈现的稳定性，就是决定是否调整账期参数的依据。如果某币种的 gap_ratio 在连续数周同号且量级相近，那是时序偏差的信号；如果正负交替且量级随机，那是基础数据质量问题而非参数问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可视性的组织约束\">可视性的组织约束</h2><p>技术上看，把成员账户余额接入集团系统并不难。难的是成员为什么愿意。三个现实约束：</p>\n<p><strong>法律实体的独立性。</strong> 成员是独立法人，其董事会与债权人利益不必然与集团一致。在没有协议授权的情况下，集团强制查看或扣划成员资金可能构成对少数股东或债权人利益的侵害。这正是资金池协议要在<a href=\"../cash-pool-structure/crossborder-pool-fx-regulatory\">跨境归集的外汇/资本项目监管约束</a>中作为备案材料提交的原因——它证明各方权利义务已明确。</p>\n<p><strong>本地法域的账户保密与数据出境。</strong> 部分法域限制账户信息出境，实时可视性在这些地区必须降级为汇总上报或延后上报。</p>\n<p><strong>激励对齐。</strong> 成员配合归集的动力来自内部计息——资金被归集时成员要收到合理的内部利息，否则它会倾向于在体外保留资金。这一机制依赖<a href=\"../intercompany-funding-transfer/fund-transfer-pricing-interest\">内部资金转移定价（FTP）与利息</a>的定价合理性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预测与投资-应急的衔接\">预测与投资、应急的衔接</h2><p>预测的输出有两个直接消费者。<strong>向上</strong>：可投资资金规模进入短期投资决策，见<a href=\"shortterm-investment-yield\">短期投资与闲置资金收益</a>。<strong>向下</strong>：悲观分位之外的缺口进入应急额度设计，见<a href=\"../treasury-risk-metric/liquidity-risk-contingency\">流动性风险与应急额度</a>。预测质量直接决定这两者的规模——预测越准，需要持有的低收益缓冲越少，可投资的资金越多，这是预测准确度最直接的价值体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>预测输入分确定项、统计项、推断项三类，可靠性与方法各不相同，不能混在一个模型里。</li>\n<li>短期预测的核心是减少方差，长期预测的核心是覆盖情景，两者建模逻辑相反。</li>\n<li>预测应以分位数给出：按悲观分位保留缓冲、按乐观分位之外安排投资，不依赖参数化假设。</li>\n<li>偏差须拆成时序偏差、幅值偏差、例外事件三类，例外不得进入基础模型训练。</li>\n<li>可视性受法律实体独立性、本地数据出境限制、激励对齐三重约束，不只是技术问题。</li>\n<li>预测准确度直接决定流动性缓冲规模与可投资资金规模，是最有杠杆的改进点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨主体现金流预测与可视性","id":"跨主体现金流预测与可视性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"预测的粒度与时间桶","id":"预测的粒度与时间桶"},{"level":3,"text":"三个时间尺度","id":"三个时间尺度"},{"level":3,"text":"时间桶的选择","id":"时间桶的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"分位数而非点估计","id":"分位数而非点估计"},{"level":2,"text":"偏差归因与预测修正","id":"偏差归因与预测修正"},{"level":3,"text":"偏差的三个来源","id":"偏差的三个来源"},{"level":3,"text":"滚动修正的实现","id":"滚动修正的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"可视性的组织约束","id":"可视性的组织约束"},{"level":2,"text":"预测与投资、应急的衔接","id":"预测与投资-应急的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多币种头寸与双边/多边净额","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/position-netting-liquidity/multicurrency-position-netting"},"next":{"title":"短期投资与闲置资金收益","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/position-netting-liquidity/shortterm-investment-yield"}}